      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What you're describing is a deep, unsettling sense of meaninglessness, which is often called existential dread. It's a very human reaction to realizing that the universe doesn't inherently offer you a script. Instead of seeing a \"bigger plan,\" you can find a profound sense of freedom in choosing what matters to *you* right now. You have the power to create your own purpose, even if it's small and temporary.",
